{"entries":[{"title":"Untitled","url":"/contact/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us 🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 Home>Contact Contact Contact Reach us at hello@meridian-systems.com. We'd love to hear from you. We aim to reply within two business days.","headings":["Contact","Contact"]},{"title":"Untitled","url":"/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文MeridianCompliance-grade software for regulated industries — clinical trials, public procurement, financial reconciliation.Get Started Learn MoreCompliance-grade software, with the patience to ship it wellMeridian Systems builds back-office software for regulated industries: clinical trial coordination, financial reconciliation, public-sector procurement. We work alongside your in-house team for 12-to-18-month engagements and stay on for the long maintenance tail nobody else wants.What we deliverAudit-ready code — every change traces back to a ticket, every ticket to a requirement, every requirement to a stakeholder sign-offZero JavaScript on customer-facing pages — the most accessible, fastest, and most cacheable HTML you can shipWCAG 2.1 AA compliance — automated and manual testing, signed off before every releaseEAA-ready by default — every site we ship after June 2025 meets European Accessibility Act baselineCSP, HSTS, COOP, COEP — security headers configured per OWASP guidance, not the framework defaults30-day uptime SLA — 99.95% measured at the customer's edge, not at our load balancerRecent client workNHS England — clinical trial recruitment portal serving 137 trial sites, WCAG 2.1 AA, full audit trailCrown Commercial Service — supplier reconciliation tool processing £2.4B in annual contractsBank of England — internal tooling for the Prudential Regulation Authority (under NDA — happy to discuss in person)How we workTwo-week paid discovery. We document the system as it stands today and write down the constraints we'd otherwise miss.Co-located team for the first quarter. Our designers and engineers sit with yours; nothing happens in a Slack channel they can't see.Fortnightly demos to stakeholders. Every Wednesday, every fortnight, no slides — just the working software.Open handover from day one. Source, decision records, and runbooks live in your repo, not ours.Why teams hire usNo surprise invoices. Fixed-price discovery, time-and-materials with monthly caps after that.No subcontracting offshore. The names on the proposal are the people who write the code.No five-year exit cliff. Maintenance contracts are renewed annually with a 90-day exit clause both ways.Get in touchEmail hello@meridian-systems.com or call +44 20 7946 0123 during UK office hours. We answer within one business day.Or read more about how we work.","headings":["Meridian","Compliance-grade software, with the patience to ship it well","What we deliver","Recent client work","How we work","Why teams hire us","Get in touch"]},{"title":"Untitled","url":"/posts/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us 🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 Home>Posts Posts Posts News and updates will appear here.","headings":["Posts","Posts"]},{"title":"Untitled","url":"/privacy/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us 🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 Home>Privacy Policy Privacy Policy Privacy Policy Meridian Systems respects your privacy. We collect no personal data through this website. No cookies, no tracking, no JavaScript. Last updated: <DATE>","headings":["Privacy Policy","Privacy Policy"]},{"title":"Untitled","url":"/tags/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us 🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 Home>Explore by Tag Explore by Tag Explore by Tag Browse all content organised by topic. Featured Tags (14) GDPR (3 Posts) April 15, 2026: Contact - Contact Meridian Systems April 15, 2026: Posts - Latest news and updates April 15, 2026: Privacy Policy - How Meridian Systems handles your data WCAG (1 Posts) April 15, 2026: Explore by Tag - Browse Meridian Systems content by tag Accessibility (1 Posts) April 15, 2026: Explore by Tag - Browse Meridian Systems content by tag Compliance (1 Posts) April 15, 2026: Explore by Tag - Browse Meridian Systems content by tag Enterprise (1 Posts) April 15, 2026: Explore by Tag - Browse Meridian Systems content by tag Example (1 Posts) April 16, 2026: Meridian Systems - Compliance-grade software for regulated industries. Landing (1 Posts) April 16, 2026: Meridian Systems - Compliance-grade software for regulated industries. Privacy (3 Posts) April 15, 2026: Contact - Contact Meridian Systems April 15, 2026: Posts - Latest news and updates April 15, 2026: Privacy Policy - How Meridian Systems handles your data Security (1 Posts) April 15, 2026: Explore by Tag - Browse Meridian Systems content by tag Ssg (1 Posts) April 16, 2026: Meridian Systems - Compliance-grade software for regulated industries.","headings":["Explore by Tag","Explore by Tag","Featured Tags (14)","GDPR (3 Posts)","WCAG (1 Posts)","Accessibility (1 Posts)","Compliance (1 Posts)","Enterprise (1 Posts)","Example (1 Posts)","Landing (1 Posts)","Privacy (3 Posts)","Security (1 Posts)","Ssg (1 Posts)"]}]}
